<h1>Shipping &amp; Exchange</h1><p>Last updated: July 25, 2026</p><p>Pillar is a fully digital product. There is nothing to ship physically — access is delivered instantly through the app. This page explains how delivery works and how you can exchange or change your subscription plan.</p><h2>1. Digital Delivery — No Physical Shipping</h2><p>Pillar is a digital subscription service. We do not sell or ship any physical goods, so no shipping, courier, or delivery charges ever apply.</p><ul><li>•When your payment is successful, access to your paid features is granted instantly within the app.</li><li>•There is no waiting period, tracking number, or physical delivery involved.</li><li>•Your subscription is tied to your Pillar account and is available on your device as soon as payment is confirmed.</li></ul><h2>2. When Access Is Activated</h2><p>Paid access is activated automatically the moment your UPI or other payment is confirmed by our payment partner. In rare cases where a payment is delayed or held for verification, access is granted as soon as the payment is confirmed.</p><p>If you have completed a payment but do not see your paid features within a few minutes, please close and reopen the app. If it still does not appear, contact us and we will resolve it promptly.</p><h2>3. Exchanging or Changing Your Plan</h2><p>Because Pillar is a digital service, there are no physical items to return or exchange. “Exchange” here means changing your subscription plan — for example, switching between monthly and annual, or upgrading and downgrading.</p><ul><li>•You can change your plan any time from the app under Settings → Subscription, or by contacting us.</li><li>•Upgrades take effect immediately, and any applicable difference is adjusted at the time of change.</li><li>•Downgrades take effect from your next billing cycle, so you keep your current benefits until then.</li></ul><p>For details on cancelling a plan or getting a refund, please see our Cancellation &amp; Refund policy.</p><h2>4. Contact Us</h2><p>For any questions about delivery, activation, or changing your plan, please reach out:</p><ul><li>•Email: getinclined@gmail.com</li><li>•We aim to respond within 5 business days.</li></ul><a href="/">Back to home</a><a href="/cancellation-refund">Cancellation &amp; Refund →</a>
  </article>
</Base>
